<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/benchbench-cloning-20261106-benchmark-construct-design> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#scopeNote> "15 tasks derived from published studies, Addgene records or authored sequences. Six supply experimental records from the source study, such as sequencing reads or gel images. Agents return an annotated construct sequence, orderable primers where required, a construction plan and a written justification. Every task has a deterministic grader over the returned sequences, their source and the construction route; ten also use a rubric-based GPT-6 Astra judge of the written reasoning and plan, and for those the final score is the product of the deterministic result and the rubric score. An attempt passes at a final score of at least 0.9." <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
