<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/benchbench-cloning-20261106-benchmark-protocol-development> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#limitations> "Footnote 1 offers only the construct-design tasks, graders and reference solutions for download; it makes no release claim for this set. The construct-design tasks, graders and reference solutions are said in footnote 1 (page 3) to be available at https://github.com/benchling/benchbench-cloning. That URL returned HTTP 404 from both the web page and the GitHub API on 2026-11-06 at 2026-11-06T11:51:23Z, a repository search for 'benchbench-cloning' returned no results, and the repository is absent from benchling's public repositories. No code or data artifact was retrieved." <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
