<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/catalog-model-dnabert-2> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#profile> "{\"coverage\":\"limited\",\"diagram\":{\"caption\":\"Conceptual summary of the documented data flow; optional inputs and configured downstream stages must be reported for a reproducible evaluation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"steps\":[\"DNA sequence\",\"BPE tokens\",\"Transformer encoder\",\"Representations\",\"Specified task head\"],\"title\":\"DNABERT-2 workflow\"},\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Model type\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Masked-token DNA transformer encoder\"},{\"label\":\"Architecture\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"BERT-style DNA encoder with byte-pair tokenization, ALiBi relative attention biases and FlashAttention; task heads and pooling are separately configured.\"},{\"label\":\"Inputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"DNA sequence tokenized with the supplied tokenizer.\"},{\"label\":\"Outputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Token representations and, after a specified adaptation, task predictions.\"},{\"label\":\"Parameters\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"117 million for DNABERT-2-117M; family names do not establish a particular checkpoint.\"},{\"label\":\"Known versions\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"DNABERT-2-117M model card and official DNABERT_2 implementation.\"},{\"label\":\"Training data\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"The paper describes a 32.49-billion-base corpus covering 135 species in six groups, alongside a 2.75-billion-base human corpus. Further GUE-domain pretraining is a separately reported model variant.\"},{\"label\":\"Training cutoff\",\"source_ids\":[\"profile-review-20260923-dnabert2-paper-v2\"],\"source_locator\":\"Section4.1; Table11\",\"status\":\"unreported\",\"value\":\"Section4.1 identifies the human and 135-species corpora but does not establish a latest-sequence deposition date. The model repository revision is not a training-data cutoff.\"},{\"label\":\"Context limits\",\"source_ids\":[\"profile-review-20260923-dnabert2-paper-v2\"],\"source_locator\":\"Section5.4 Results on GUE+, printed p10; Table2 input lengths\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"The paper describes pretraining on 700-base sequences and evaluates 5,000–10,000-base GUE+ inputs after fine-tuning. This does not establish frozen-model accuracy at those lengths; tokenisation, truncation and adaptation must be specified.\"},{\"label\":\"Weights licence\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"The official zhihan1996/DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint repository carries Apache-2.0 in its pinned LICENSE. This does not assign terms to a separately fitted downstream predictor.\"},{\"label\":\"Access\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Official downloadable model/card and usage examples: https://huggingface.co/zhihan1996/DNABERT-2-117M\"},{\"label\":\"Code licence\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-25b222d11900e0e88a51\"],\"source_locator\":\"LICENSE: licence text\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Apache-2.0\"},{\"label\":\"Reference checkpoint\",\"source_ids\":[\"profile-review-20260923-dnabert2-release\"],\"source_locator\":\"sha; siblings[pytorch_model.bin].lfs.sha256\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"DNABERT-2-117M: Hugging Face revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0. Its pytorch_model.bin has registry-reported SHA-256 7ff39ec77a484dd01070a41bfd6e95cdd7247bec80fe357ab43a4be33687aeba. The weight file was not downloaded for this review.\"},{\"label\":\"Further pretraining\",\"source_ids\":[\"profile-review-20260923-dnabert2-paper-v2\"],\"source_locator\":\"Section5.2FurtherPreTraining; Table3caption\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"The diamond-marked DNABERT-2 variant receives additional masked-language-model training on GUE training sets. It must be distinguished from the base pretrained model in comparisons.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"Training cutoff: Section4.1 identifies the human and 135-species corpora but does not establish a latest-sequence deposition date. The model repository revision is not a training-data cutoff.\"],\"limitations\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"text\":\"An embedding model alone is not the same evaluated pipeline as frozen embeddings followed by logistic regression. Tokenization and pooling choices must be preserved.\"}],\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-23\",\"method\":\"automated_source_review\",\"note\":\"Follow-up review of Reference checkpoint, Context limits, Training cutoff, Further pretraining. Source locations and before/after decisions are recorded in the 23 September profile-evidence audit. Other explanatory content retains its earlier source scope. No human scientific review or independent reproduction is implied.\"},\"sections\":[{\"body\":\"DNABERT-2 merges recurring DNA substrings into byte-pair tokens, then processes those tokens with a masked-language-model transformer. ALiBi supplies distance-dependent attention biases, while FlashAttention changes how attention is computed. The resulting contextual embeddings need an explicit pooling rule and prediction head for a downstream task.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"title\":\"How it works\"},{\"body\":\"DNABERT-2-117M model card and official DNABERT_2 implementation. ALiBi permits inference beyond the pretraining sequence length, subject to attention/memory cost; this does not establish unlimited biological context or validated accuracy at arbitrary lengths.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"title\":\"Versions and reproducibility\"}],\"strengths\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\",\"text\":\"The released model supports embedding extraction and task-specific fine-tuning.\"}],\"summary\":\"DNABERT-2 learns DNA representations that can be adapted to genomic prediction tasks.\",\"summary_source_ids\":[\"evidence-official-7267eabca7c4a7945878\",\"evidence-official-2cf0a41fec83ee9c5cc9\",\"evidence-official-96b5c3a31a50f7c259d6\",\"evidence-official-a48ae27aa000bdab7442\",\"evidence-official-3aa749d3205c0a768b22\"],\"summary_source_locator\":\"DNABERT-2 paper Sections 3.2, 4.1 and 5.2 (Further Pre-Training); official model card and implementation README; official DNABERT-2-117M checkpoint LICENSE at revision 7bce263b15377fc15361f52cfab88f8b586abda0\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
