<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-atom3d> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#profile> "{\"coverage\":\"reviewed\",\"diagram\":{\"caption\":\"Conceptual procedure. Task variants and protocol versions retain their separate scoring conditions.\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\",\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities; Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"steps\":[\"Allowed inputs: Three-dimensional molecular coordinates and task labels; supported formats include PDB, SDF and XYZ.\",\"Splits: Task-specific: random molecules for SMP; 30% protein sequence identity for PIP, MSP and the strict LBA split; CATH topology groups for RES; protein targets for LEP; competition years for PSR and RSR. LBA also provides a less restrictive 60% identity split.\",\"Metrics: SMP: MAE; PIP/MSP/LEP: classification AUROC; RES: accuracy; LBA: RMSE and correlations; PSR/RSR: correlations of predicted structure quality with reference GDT_TS/RMSD. Metrics and aggregation belong to each task.\"],\"title\":\"Evaluation procedure\"},\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Datasets\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Three-dimensional molecular data with associated labels/metadata; ligand-binding affinity is one documented example.\"},{\"label\":\"Splits\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Task-specific: random molecules for SMP; 30% protein sequence identity for PIP, MSP and the strict LBA split; CATH topology groups for RES; protein targets for LEP; competition years for PSR and RSR. LBA also provides a less restrictive 60% identity split.\"},{\"label\":\"Metrics\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"SMP: MAE; PIP/MSP/LEP: classification AUROC; RES: accuracy; LBA: RMSE and correlations; PSR/RSR: correlations of predicted structure quality with reference GDT_TS/RMSD. Metrics and aggregation belong to each task.\"},{\"label\":\"Baselines\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"3D CNNs, graph networks and equivariant networks are compared with task-specific 1D/2D methods; structure-ranking tasks also use established 3D methods. Appendix F documents the per-task comparators.\"},{\"label\":\"Leakage controls\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Protein-sequence, topology, target and temporal partitions reduce task-specific overlap; PIP prunes DIPS proteins against DB5. SMP uses a random molecular split, so it is not a scaffold-held-out test.\"},{\"label\":\"Uncertainty\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Table 8 reports standard deviations over three replicates. The paper distinguishes this run variation from the choice of molecular dataset and split.\"},{\"label\":\"Entity type\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Molecular dataset and evaluation suite.\"},{\"label\":\"Organisms\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"inapplicable\",\"value\":\"No single organism defines this suite of molecular structure datasets.\"},{\"label\":\"Assays\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Task-specific structural and molecular-property labels.\"},{\"label\":\"Allowed inputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Three-dimensional molecular coordinates and task labels; supported formats include PDB, SDF and XYZ.\"},{\"label\":\"Adaptation\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Supervised task evaluation; task-specific training configurations are linked separately.\"}],\"gaps\":[],\"limitations\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"text\":\"Comparisons must retain the task, split and available structural information. In particular, the two LBA identity thresholds test different generalization regimes.\"}],\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"method\":\"automated_source_review\",\"note\":\"Primary paper and/or task implementation reviewed for the explicitly cited methodology claims. Scope-limited absence is recorded only after the documented source search; no model runs or independent reproduction.\"},\"sections\":[{\"body\":\"ATOM3D evaluates predictions from molecular structures using eight separate tasks. It supplies task-specific reference labels and partitions, ranging from random small molecules to held-out protein families and future structure-prediction targets. Each task has its own metric and representation-matched baseline; the suite is not a single universal structure score.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3.1–3.8, 4–5; Appendix D–F; Table 8\",\"title\":\"Evaluation methodology\"}],\"strengths\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\",\"text\":\"Common data loaders allow different 3D representations to use the same dataset definitions.\"}],\"summary\":\"ATOM3D provides molecular-structure datasets and utilities for task-specific evaluation.\",\"summary_source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-drorlab-atom3d\"],\"summary_source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; dataset access; supported formats and splitting/filtering utilities\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-atom3d> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runDocumentation> "{\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-atom3d\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-atom3d-readme-md-4c2f3b7e\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md lines 19–70 (Installation and Usage)\",\"status\":\"official_documentation_linked\",\"summary\":\"Official installation, dataset-download and LMDB loading examples are available. These sections do not supply a complete task-specific model-training and scoring run; select the task and follow its example/documentation before reporting a benchmark result.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-atom3d> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runRecipes> "[{\"id\":\"atom3d-official\",\"inputs\":[\"A model over three-dimensional atomic structure.\"],\"instructions\":[{\"code\":\"pip install atom3d\",\"runtime\":\"command_line\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-atom3d-4c2f3b7e\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 4c2f3b7e, Installation, lines 24-24\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Install\"},{\"code\":\"import atom3d.datasets as da\\nda.download_dataset('lba', PATH_TO_DATASET) # Download LBA dataset.\",\"runtime\":\"python\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-atom3d-4c2f3b7e\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 4c2f3b7e, Downloading a dataset, lines 42-43\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Download a dataset\"},{\"code\":\"import atom3d.datasets as da\\ndataset = da.load_dataset(PATH_TO_DATASET, {'lmdb','pdb','silent','sdf','xyz','xyz-gdb'})\\nprint(len(dataset))  # Print length\\nprint(dataset[0].keys())  # Print keys\",\"runtime\":\"python\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-atom3d-4c2f3b7e\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 4c2f3b7e, Loading a dataset, lines 52-55\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Load a dataset\"}],\"limitations\":[\"Quoted from the project's README and not executed by rewire, so the commands are evidence of what the project documents rather than a verified run.\",\"The project may have changed since the pinned commit.\",\"Two of the metrics on this page are errors where lower is better.\",\"The comparison methods appear in the paper only as citations.\"],\"outputs\":[\"An LMDB dataset for the chosen task and split.\"],\"protocol_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-atom3d\",\"purpose\":\"generate_and_evaluate\",\"requirements\":{\"data\":\"Downloaded by the library into a local LMDB dataset.\",\"hardware\":\"Not stated in the cited section. Several of these steps expect a GPU.\",\"licence\":\"Project licence: MIT. Upstream data licences are separate and unreported here.\",\"software\":\"Python with the atom3d package from PyPI.\",\"weights\":\"None. The reported networks are trained from scratch.\"},\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-atom3d-4c2f3b7e\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 4c2f3b7e\",\"summary\":\"Install the library and download one of the eight three-dimensional molecular tasks scored on this page.\",\"title\":\"Download and load an ATOM3D task\",\"version\":\"4c2f3b7e9efe128791b83f03b2e8cae91e78b018\"}]"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
