<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-beeline> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#profile> "{\"coverage\":\"reviewed\",\"diagram\":{\"caption\":\"Conceptual procedure. Task variants and protocol versions retain their separate scoring conditions.\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\",\"evidence-discovery-final-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results; Methods: algorithm execution, simulated/curated datasets and experimental datasets\",\"steps\":[\"Allowed inputs: Expression matrix, gene metadata and ground-truth edges for evaluation.\",\"Splits: BEELINE infers a network from each expression dataset and scores predicted edges against a reference network. Simulated replicates and experimental contexts are separate benchmark cases; the benchmark is not a single supervised train/validation/test classification split.\",\"Metrics: AUROC, AUPRC, early-precision ratio, signed early precision, rank correlation and top-edge overlap; runtime/network diagnostics are separate outputs.\"],\"title\":\"Evaluation procedure\"},\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Datasets\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Single-cell expression inputs and ground-truth regulatory networks, configured per dataset.\"},{\"label\":\"Splits\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Methods: algorithm execution, simulated/curated datasets and experimental datasets\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"BEELINE infers a network from each expression dataset and scores predicted edges against a reference network. Simulated replicates and experimental contexts are separate benchmark cases; the benchmark is not a single supervised train/validation/test classification split.\"},{\"label\":\"Metrics\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"AUROC, AUPRC, early-precision ratio, signed early precision, rank correlation and top-edge overlap; runtime/network diagnostics are separate outputs.\"},{\"label\":\"Baselines\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Containerized inference methods share ranked-edge outputs for a common evaluator.\"},{\"label\":\"Leakage controls\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Methods: algorithm execution, simulated/curated datasets and experimental datasets\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Reference networks are used to score inferred edges, while inputs are expression and, for some methods, pseudotime. Algorithm assumptions, simulated ground truth and experimental reference construction are explicit; no single held-out-gene training protocol applies to all methods.\"},{\"label\":\"Uncertainty\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Plotting supports multiple-run distributions, but a particular repeated-run design is not fixed by the README.\"},{\"label\":\"Entity type\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Gene-regulatory network inference evaluation pipeline.\"},{\"label\":\"Organisms\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Human transcription-factor metadata is supported; the chosen single-cell dataset defines organism scope.\"},{\"label\":\"Assays\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Single-cell expression with a reference regulatory network.\"},{\"label\":\"Allowed inputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Expression matrix, gene metadata and ground-truth edges for evaluation.\"},{\"label\":\"Adaptation\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Inference algorithms operate on the supplied expression data; labeled reference edges are used for assessment.\"}],\"gaps\":[],\"limitations\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Methods: algorithm execution, simulated/curated datasets and experimental datasets\",\"text\":\"An inferred association is not automatically a causal regulatory edge. Simulated ground truth, curated biological models and experimentally assembled references support different conclusions.\"}],\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"method\":\"automated_source_review\",\"note\":\"Primary paper and/or task implementation reviewed for the explicitly cited methodology claims. Scope-limited absence is recorded only after the documented source search; no model runs or independent reproduction.\"},\"sections\":[{\"body\":\"BEELINE evaluates gene regulatory network inference from single-cell expression. It runs inference algorithms on synthetic, curated-model and experimental datasets, then compares ranked predicted edges with known or constructed reference networks. Pseudotime requirements and reference-network reliability are part of each evaluation.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Methods: algorithm execution, simulated/curated datasets and experimental datasets\",\"title\":\"Evaluation methodology\"}],\"strengths\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\",\"text\":\"Ranked-edge evaluation exposes precision–recall behavior rather than treating a thresholded graph as ground truth.\"}],\"summary\":\"BEELINE compares inferred gene-regulatory edge rankings with reference networks.\",\"summary_source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-murali-group-beeline\"],\"summary_source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Overview; Running algorithms; Evaluate results metric table; Plot results\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-beeline> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runDocumentation> "{\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-beeline\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\",\"run-doc-beeline-config-yaml-37464085\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md Setup and Usage; config-files/config.yaml input_settings and output_settings\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"summary\":\"Run and evaluate the supplied BEELINE GSD example configuration, then generate AUPRC/AUROC plots. The README VSC command references a configuration absent from the pinned repository. This guide uses the checked-in GSD example instead and does not claim VSC results.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-beeline> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runGuide> "{\"limitations\":[\"The README VSC command references a configuration absent from the pinned repository. This guide uses the checked-in GSD example instead and does not claim VSC results.\",\"The Docker tags are not image-digest pinned by the README; this code revision alone does not freeze algorithm containers.\",\"Ground-truth network availability and matching input/configuration paths are prerequisites; no data-download command is invented.\",\"The inspected instructions do not establish a minimum RAM/VRAM requirement, wall-clock runtime or monetary cost; none is inferred.\"],\"outputs\":[\"Ranked edges under outputs/example_run_GSD/GSD/<run_id>/<algorithm_id>/rankedEdges.csv, using output_settings in the supplied config.\",\"AUPRC and AUROC plot files under ./plots in PDF and PNG formats.\"],\"prerequisites\":[\"Git, conda and a functioning Docker installation; the repository executes supported algorithms in containers.\",\"The supplied config-files/config.yaml expects GSD expression, pseudotime and ground-truth files under inputs/example/GSD. Verify the local data layout before running.\"],\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-beeline\",\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-17\",\"method\":\"official_repository_review\"},\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\",\"run-doc-beeline-config-yaml-37464085\"],\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"steps\":[{\"explanation\":\"Repository checkout wrapper: the detached revision selects the exact official source inspected for this guide.\",\"shell\":\"git clone https://github.com/Murali-group/Beeline.git\\ncd Beeline\\ngit checkout --detach 37464085eb8a95d6cc6a3d3a3c649d36db6052ed\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned repository revision; README.md\",\"title\":\"Check out the reviewed repository\"},{\"explanation\":\"These setup commands use the official default image-pull behavior. Conda must already be initialized in the shell; the README illustrates a Miniconda-specific initialization path.\",\"shell\":\"bash utils/setupAnacondaVENV.sh\\nbash utils/initialize.sh\\nconda activate BEELINE\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md lines 9–36\",\"title\":\"Set up the environment and algorithm images\"},{\"explanation\":\"This executes the algorithms and datasets enabled by the YAML file. The README points to a missing VSC file; this guide explicitly substitutes the supplied GSD example config, so it is a different example dataset.\",\"shell\":\"python BLRunner.py -c config-files/config.yaml\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\",\"run-doc-beeline-config-yaml-37464085\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md lines 40–52; config-files/config.yaml (input_settings/datasets and output_settings)\",\"title\":\"Run the configured algorithms\"},{\"explanation\":\"The flags are selected from the official tables: evaluator -a computes AUPRC/AUROC; plotter -a and -r produce their corresponding figures. The README points to a missing VSC file; this guide explicitly substitutes the supplied GSD example config, so it is a different example dataset.\",\"shell\":\"python BLEvaluator.py -c config-files/config.yaml -a\\npython BLPlotter.py -c config-files/config.yaml -o ./plots -a -r\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-beeline-readme-md-37464085\",\"run-doc-beeline-config-yaml-37464085\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md lines 54–85; config-files/config.yaml (input_settings/datasets and output_settings)\",\"title\":\"Evaluate and plot ROC/precision-recall performance\"}],\"summary\":\"Run and evaluate the supplied BEELINE GSD example configuration, then generate AUPRC/AUROC plots.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
