<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-bend> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#entityClassification> "{\"ambiguities\":[],\"rationale\":\"The cited profile describes a collection of evaluation tasks or protocols; retain it as the top-level benchmark suite. Its datasets and individual protocols remain separate records.\",\"review_date\":\"2026-09-17\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
