<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-bend> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#profile> "{\"coverage\":\"limited\",\"diagram\":{\"caption\":\"Conceptual procedure. Task variants and protocol versions retain their separate scoring conditions.\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\",\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines; Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"steps\":[\"Allowed inputs: DNA sequences extracted from genomic coordinates and a reference genome; complex labels align by index to HDF5 records.\",\"Splits: BED task files contain an explicit split column, and paired label files share the same row index.\",\"Metrics: Gene finding uses multiclass MCC; enhancer annotation uses AUPRC; chromatin accessibility, histone modification and methylation use label-wise AUROC; variant-effect tasks use AUROC.\"],\"title\":\"Evaluation procedure\"},\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Datasets\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Genomic-coordinate tables paired with labels, including HDF5 labels for complex outputs; reference genome supplies input sequences.\"},{\"label\":\"Splits\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"BED task files contain an explicit split column, and paired label files share the same row index.\"},{\"label\":\"Metrics\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Gene finding uses multiclass MCC; enhancer annotation uses AUPRC; chromatin accessibility, histone modification and methylation use label-wise AUROC; variant-effect tasks use AUROC.\"},{\"label\":\"Baselines\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"A one-hot two-layer CNN is matched to frozen-embedding probes. Task specialists include AUGUSTUS, Enformer, Basset and DeepSEA, and the study includes supervised ResNet and simple pretrained language-model controls.\"},{\"label\":\"Leakage controls\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Appendix A.1.1 gene-finding split: mature-protein identity; other supervised task and enhancer split descriptions in Appendix A.1\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Supervised tasks hold out chromosomes, except gene finding, whose cross-partition pairs share no more than 80% identity of the mature protein. Enhancer evaluation uses ten chromosome-based folds. Variant effects are zero-shot tests; these partitions do not by themselves remove unsupervised genome-pretraining exposure.\"},{\"label\":\"Uncertainty\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"status\":\"unreported\",\"value\":\"Enhancer evaluation uses ten-fold cross-validation because the dataset is small. Table 3 does not provide a uniform repeated-seed confidence-interval protocol for all task/model scores; its Enformer ± entry must not be generalized to every row.\"},{\"label\":\"Entity type\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Human genomic task benchmark suite.\"},{\"label\":\"Organisms\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Human genomic evaluation; the README distinguishes models trained on other organisms from the evaluated set.\"},{\"label\":\"Assays\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Task-dependent regulatory and annotation datasets, including ENCODE-derived resources.\"},{\"label\":\"Allowed inputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"DNA sequences extracted from genomic coordinates and a reference genome; complex labels align by index to HDF5 records.\"},{\"label\":\"Adaptation\",\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Downstream supervised models use precomputed embeddings; unsupervised variant-effect scoring is a separate evaluation route.\"}],\"gaps\":[\"Uncertainty: Enhancer evaluation uses ten-fold cross-validation because the dataset is small. Table 3 does not provide a uniform repeated-seed confidence-interval protocol for all task/model scores; its Enformer ± entry must not be generalized to every row.\"],\"limitations\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"text\":\"BEND measures different biological tasks with different metrics. Its zero-shot variant tests, frozen probes and literature specialist results require separate interpretation; pretraining on the reference genome is not equivalent to supervised label leakage.\"}],\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"method\":\"automated_source_review\",\"note\":\"Primary paper and/or task implementation reviewed for the explicitly cited methodology claims. Scope-limited absence is recorded only after the documented source search; no model runs or independent reproduction. Independent automated spot review corrected interval terminology and sequence-identity scope against the original figure captions and methods.\"},\"sections\":[{\"body\":\"BEND asks whether DNA representations support realistic human-genome annotation across short and long contexts. Frozen embeddings feed a small CNN for supervised tasks, while variant-effect prediction compares reference and alternate embeddings without fitting a task predictor. Whole-chromosome or sequence-identity partitions and specialist baselines make the tested capability explicit.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Sections 3–4, Table 1, Table 3, Appendix A.1 and A.6\",\"title\":\"Evaluation methodology\"}],\"strengths\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\",\"text\":\"Explicit split columns and aligned label indices make task membership inspectable.\"}],\"summary\":\"BEND evaluates DNA representations using task-specific genomic annotations and explicit split membership.\",\"summary_source_ids\":[\"src-discovery-frederikkemarin-bend\"],\"summary_source_locator\":\"Pinned README: Data format; dataset use; Citation Guidelines\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-bend> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runDocumentation> "{\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-bend\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-embed-yaml-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad410, lines 39-43, 48, 58, 115-117 and 148-152; conf/embedding/embed.yaml at 58ad410, lines 39-40, 77-82 and 106-109\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"summary\":\"Run the official gene-finding downstream example with BEND's own ResNet-LM and AWD-LSTM embedders, fetching only the gene-finding inputs. This is one BEND task, not the entire suite. Commands were source-reviewed only. No hardware minimum, runtime or monetary cost is stated in these README sections; no cost estimate is inferred.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-bend> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runGuide> "{\"limitations\":[\"No hardware minimum, runtime or monetary cost is stated in these README sections; no cost estimate is inferred.\",\"Checkpoint downloads, dataset bytes and transitive dependencies are not checksum-pinned by this guide. Pinning the repository does not pin those external resources.\",\"Changing the data, embedder or Hydra settings changes the evaluation configuration; this example does not establish reproduction of a published score.\",\"The gene-finding-only download and the narrowed task list are Rewire's changes to the README example, not upstream instructions. Each correction to this guide is recorded as a claim with an ID starting bend-recipe-corrections-20261119.\"],\"outputs\":[\"Embedding shards under data/<task_name>/<embedder>/*.tar.gz.\",\"Downstream run results under downstream_tasks/gene_finding/<embedder>/.\"],\"prerequisites\":[\"Git and a conda environment with Python 3.10; the README recommends this Python version.\",\"curl and wget on the PATH: the download step uses curl, and BEND's embedders call wget to fetch their checkpoints.\",\"About 3.7 GB of disk: 3.5 GB for the gene-finding inputs and 166 MB for the two checkpoints, plus room for the embeddings.\",\"Internet access to the official data host, sid.erda.dk. Preserve the downloaded data directory structure.\"],\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-bend\",\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-11-19\",\"method\":\"official_repository_review\"},\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-requirements-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-embed-yaml-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-commit-58ad4101\"],\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"steps\":[{\"explanation\":\"The clone command comes from the README; the detached checkout selects commit 58ad410, the first revision with working checkpoint links (BEND PR #79).\",\"shell\":\"git clone https://github.com/frederikkemarin/BEND.git\\ncd BEND\\ngit checkout --detach 58ad41011125cfca339d511e9b8eb536a54b582a\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad410, lines 39-40; pinned repository revision\",\"title\":\"Check out the reviewed code\"},{\"explanation\":\"Run within the prepared Python 3.10 environment. From commit 58ad410 requirements.txt includes lxml, h5py and pysam, which earlier revisions lacked. The curl loop replaces python scripts/download_bend.py, which downloads the whole share (7,251,859,341 bytes listed on 2026-11-17). Gene finding reads only the GRCh38 reference and the gene_finding bed and hdf5 files, 3,509,054,493 bytes with the index. The README asks for the data folder structure to be kept, which these paths do.\",\"shell\":\"pip install -r requirements.txt\\npip install -e .\\nS=https://sid.erda.dk/share_redirect/aNQa0Oz2lY\\nmkdir -p data/genomes data/gene_finding\\nfor f in GRCh38.primary_assembly.genome.fa GRCh38.primary_assembly.genome.fa.fai; do\\n  curl -fL -o \\\"data/genomes/$f\\\" \\\"$S/data/genomes/$f\\\"\\ndone\\nfor f in gene_finding.bed gene_finding.hdf5; do\\n  curl -fL -o \\\"data/gene_finding/$f\\\" \\\"$S/data/gene_finding/$f\\\"\\ndone\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-requirements-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-embed-yaml-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad410, lines 41-43 and 48; requirements.txt at 58ad410, lines 14-19; conf/embedding/embed.yaml at 58ad410, lines 39 and 106-109\",\"title\":\"Install and download the gene-finding data\"},{\"explanation\":\"Adapted from the README example, with the task list narrowed to gene_finding because only those inputs are fetched. When pretrained_models/convnet/ or pretrained_models/awd_lstm/ is missing, ConvNetEmbedder and AWDLSTMEmbedder download the checkpoints with wget from ERDA share aNQa0Oz2lY. The resnetlm configuration loads pretrained_models/convnet, which the maintainer confirmed holds the paper's dilated ResNet; the resnetlm folder on the share is empty. To fetch the checkpoints ahead of time, call bend.utils.download.download_model('convnet', destination_dir='./pretrained_models/convnet/') and the same for 'awd_lstm'. With its default destination_dir the function writes the files directly into ./pretrained_models/, where the configuration does not look.\",\"shell\":\"python scripts/precompute_embeddings.py model=resnetlm,awdlstm task=gene_finding\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-embed-yaml-58ad4101\",\"bend-recipe-corrections-20261119-source-commit-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad410, line 58; conf/embedding/embed.yaml at 58ad410, lines 40 and 77-82; commit 58ad410, bend/utils/download.py and bend/utils/embedders.py\",\"title\":\"Precompute the gene-finding embeddings\"},{\"explanation\":\"Run after gene-finding embeddings are present in data/gene_finding/<embedder>/. Task-specific Hydra configuration supplies the data, model and evaluation settings.\",\"shell\":\"python scripts/train_on_task.py --config-name gene_finding embedder=resnetlm,awdlstm\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad410, lines 115-117 and 148-152\",\"title\":\"Train and evaluate gene finding\"}],\"summary\":\"Run the official gene-finding downstream example with BEND's own ResNet-LM and AWD-LSTM embedders, fetching only the gene-finding inputs. This is one BEND task, not the entire suite.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-bend> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runRecipes> "[{\"id\":\"bend-official\",\"inputs\":[\"A supported embedder, or your own.\",\"The task data the repository downloads.\"],\"instructions\":[{\"code\":\"python scripts/precompute_embeddings.py model=resnetlm,awdlstm task=gene_finding,enhancer_annotation\",\"runtime\":\"command_line\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad4101, 3. Computing embeddings, lines 58-58\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Precompute embeddings\"},{\"code\":\"python scripts/train_on_task.py --config-name gene_finding embedder=resnetlm,awdlstm\",\"runtime\":\"command_line\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad4101, Training and evaluating supervised models, lines 117-117\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Train and evaluate on a task\"},{\"code\":\"python3 scripts/predict_variant_effects.py {variant_file_name}.bed {output_file_name}.csv {model_type} {path_to_checkpoint} {path_to_reference_genome_fasta} --embedding_idx {position_of_embedding}\",\"runtime\":\"command_line\",\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad4101, Unsupervised tasks, lines 162-162\",\"status\":\"source_reviewed_not_executed\",\"title\":\"Score variant effects\"}],\"limitations\":[\"Quoted from the project's README and not executed by rewire, so the commands are evidence of what the project documents rather than a verified run.\",\"The project may have changed since the pinned commit.\",\"The metric differs by task, so the figures on this page cannot be averaged.\",\"The expert entries on this page are specialist models, each compared on one task only.\"],\"outputs\":[\"Precomputed embeddings and a scored downstream model.\"],\"protocol_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-bend\",\"purpose\":\"generate_and_evaluate\",\"requirements\":{\"data\":\"Downloaded by the repository's scripts.\",\"hardware\":\"Not stated in the cited section. Several of these steps expect a GPU.\",\"licence\":\"Project licence: BSD-3-Clause. Upstream data licences are separate and unreported here.\",\"software\":\"Python with the repository's environment and hydra configs.\",\"weights\":\"A published DNA language model checkpoint.\"},\"source_ids\":[\"project-recipe-bend-58ad4101\"],\"source_locator\":\"README.md at 58ad4101\",\"summary\":\"Precompute embeddings for a DNA language model, then train and score the downstream head on one of the seven tasks.\",\"title\":\"Embed, train and evaluate on a BEND task\",\"version\":\"58ad41011125cfca339d511e9b8eb536a54b582a\"}]"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
