<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-cafa> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#benchmarkResearch> "{\"claim_scope\":\"Primary-source discovery and table/protocol screening; source checked is not independently reproduced. Raw acquisitions not automatically numerical publication approval.\",\"gaps\":[\"Main tables describe participation and benchmark construction; numerical performance is mainly in figures/supplementary files. CAFA versions, ontology branch, full/partial mode and no/limited-knowledge cohorts must remain separate. No scores estimated from plot pixels.\"],\"inspected_locators\":[\"Tables1–3; protein-function prediction evaluation and challenge results\"],\"primary_sources\":[\"evidence-expansion-p2-evidence-discovery-final-cafa3-3802f37548d7\"],\"review_date\":\"2026-09-17\",\"searched_queries\":[\"CAFA primary paper benchmark results\"],\"status\":\"source_found_structured_extraction_pending\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
