<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-cafa> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#entityClassification> "{\"ambiguities\":[],\"rationale\":\"The cited profile describes an organized challenge with category- or round-specific evaluation rules; retain it as a top-level benchmark, without conflating different editions or protocols.\",\"review_date\":\"2026-09-17\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
