<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-cafa> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#profile> "{\"coverage\":\"reviewed\",\"diagram\":{\"caption\":\"Conceptual procedure. Task variants and protocol versions retain their separate scoring conditions.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\",\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline; Methods: Protein-centric and term-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"steps\":[\"Allowed inputs: Challenge target protein sequences and permitted pre-deadline knowledge.\",\"Splits: Prospective temporal assessment separates prediction submission from subsequent annotation growth.\",\"Metrics: CAFA3 protein-centric evaluation uses Fmax and semantic distance Smin, with prediction coverage reported. Term-centric assays also use AUROC. Ontology, knowledge category and full/partial evaluation mode must accompany the score.\"],\"title\":\"Evaluation procedure\"},\"facts\":[{\"label\":\"Datasets\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Protein sequences supplied for a challenge; proteins gaining experimental annotations after the deadline become evaluation targets.\"},{\"label\":\"Splits\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Prospective temporal assessment separates prediction submission from subsequent annotation growth.\"},{\"label\":\"Metrics\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"Methods: Protein-centric and term-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"CAFA3 protein-centric evaluation uses Fmax and semantic distance Smin, with prediction coverage reported. Term-centric assays also use AUROC. Ontology, knowledge category and full/partial evaluation mode must accompany the score.\"},{\"label\":\"Baselines\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"CAFA3 Methods: Protein-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"In CAFA3 protein-centric evaluation, Naïve predicts each term’s training-set frequency and BLAST transfers annotations using the highest matching sequence identity. Term-centric experiments also include expression-based comparators where available.\"},{\"label\":\"Leakage controls\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Newly acquired experimental annotations are used for later assessment; exact knowledge-cutoff controls depend on the challenge edition.\"},{\"label\":\"Uncertainty\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"CAFA3 Methods: Protein-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"CAFA3 Figures 3–4 estimate 95% confidence intervals with 10,000 bootstrap samples of benchmark proteins. This is a version-specific evaluation, not a universal rule for every CAFA round.\"},{\"label\":\"Entity type\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Prospective protein-function prediction challenge.\"},{\"label\":\"Organisms\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Protein targets spanning challenge-selected taxa.\"},{\"label\":\"Assays\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Experimental functional annotations acquired after the prediction deadline.\"},{\"label\":\"Allowed inputs\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Challenge target protein sequences and permitted pre-deadline knowledge.\"},{\"label\":\"Adaptation\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"status\":\"source_checked\",\"value\":\"Methods submit predictions before the target proteins gain evaluation annotations.\"}],\"gaps\":[],\"limitations\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"CAFA3 Methods: Protein-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"text\":\"Annotation incompleteness, prediction coverage and the challenge’s ontology version affect interpretation. New CAFA rounds may revise the eligible proteins, metrics and uncertainty procedure.\"}],\"review\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"method\":\"automated_source_review\",\"note\":\"Primary paper and/or task implementation reviewed for the explicitly cited methodology claims. Scope-limited absence is recorded only after the documented source search; no model runs or independent reproduction.\"},\"sections\":[{\"body\":\"CAFA is a time-delayed protein-function challenge: predictions are submitted before new experimental annotations become available. Evaluation then compares predictions with those newly added labels, separately by ontology and evaluation mode. CAFA3 provides explicit frequency and homology-transfer baselines and protein-level bootstrap intervals.\",\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-discovery-final-cafa3\"],\"source_locator\":\"CAFA3 Methods: Protein-centric evaluation; Figures 3–4\",\"title\":\"Evaluation methodology\"}],\"strengths\":[{\"source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\",\"text\":\"Time-delayed annotation supplies a prospective assessment boundary.\"}],\"summary\":\"CAFA evaluates prospective protein-function predictions against annotations that become available after prediction submission.\",\"summary_source_ids\":[\"evidence-benchmark-cafa-20260916\"],\"summary_source_locator\":\"Official CAFA page: The problem; The solution; challenge timeline\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
<https://benchmarks.rewire.it/id/discovery-benchmark-cafa> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/vocab#runDocumentation> "{\"record_id\":\"discovery-benchmark-cafa\",\"source_ids\":[\"run-doc-cafa-evaluator-readme-md-d09ba823\"],\"source_locator\":\"CAFA-evaluator README.md lines 22–72 (Installation and Usage); challenge landing page retrieval failed\",\"status\":\"official_documentation_linked\",\"summary\":\"The CAFA-evaluator authors document a CLI taking ontology, prediction directory and ground-truth files. Pin the challenge edition, ontology and ground truth separately; running the evaluator is not equivalent to entering a blind challenge. The challenge landing page was unavailable during retrieval, but the evaluator README was inspected and pinned.\"}"^^<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#JSON> <https://benchmarks.rewire.it/graph/asserted> .
